      "evidence": [
        "2026-10-26 (0.1.0): built from the local models that were already installed, after SCAIL-2 runs kept returning the clip without the reference. Same clip and picture as docs/REPLACE-MODEL-COMPARE.md (asset 806b049c, picture A). The anchor is the clip's first frame with the picture edited onto the masked person by Flux 2 Klein in a masked inpaint crop; Wan Animate 2 then animates that anchor from the clip's SDPose skeleton, and the render is composited back over the source through the same SAM 3.1 person mask. The packed graph ran as shipped (prompt 0cc56da2, 81 frames of the user clip in 447 s at 23.4 GB). Identity is closer to the picture than SCAIL-2's face and hair. The second relay window does not run in this build: a two-member BatchImagesNode gives the final crop no frames, and the 157-frame attempt sat in the first sampler for ninety minutes, so the pack declares maxWindows 1 and refuses a longer clip. Numbers, frames and the honest reading are in docs/LOCAL-JUTSU.md.",
        "2026-10-31: the FLUX 2 Klein reference edit (2 pictures) was replaced by the core nodes of the official Comfy-Org template image_fibo2_edit_turbo_pe.json (Fibo 2.0 Edit Turbo int8, 4 steps); the pictures keep their order on TextEncodeFibo2's image sockets and every other node is unchanged. User decision: no FLUX 2 or Qwen for editing."
      ]
